\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (admissible-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1e68a0f54b805bf\" href=\"?note=a1e68a0f54b805bf\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal\">58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8RecursivelyMahloOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8RecursivelyMahloOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}mahlo\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8RecursivelyMahloOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq\\alpha\\;(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\beta))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}mahlo\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8RecursivelyMahloOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq\\alpha\\;(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\beta))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> is admissible and the admissible ordinals below it meet every club subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>; this is the recursive Mahloness condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-club","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-club]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"a1e68a0f54b805bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"a1e68a0f54b805bf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S$ (admissible-ordinal predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-ordinal8-admissible-ordinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8RecursivelyMahloOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}mahlo\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8RecursivelyMahloOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq\\alpha\\;(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8AdmissibleOrdinal}_S(\\beta))","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1248,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3018","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-recursively-mahlo-ordinal.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal8-recursively-mahlo-ordinal]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","04670bdc8b64b8dd","a1e68a0f54b805bf"]}